{"parentUuid":"1e2f1ccc-2062-4b86-ba39-adb39edf83e7","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"47447b9e-7648-4dba-9c9c-be7a9ed1437f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MyesbFR8564NScAuY16kKF","type":"tool_result","content":"    /// Reconnect on transport error / non-1000 close.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub reconnect: bool,\n\n    /// Fixed wait (seconds) between reconnect attempts. Default 1s.\n    #[serde(\n        default = \"default_backoff\",\n        with = \"faucet_core::config::duration_secs\"\n16:- **Automatic reconnect** — opt-in `reconnect` with a fixed `reconnect_backoff` and an optional cap on *consecutive* failures (`max_reconnect_attempts`). The idle clock spans reconnect gaps, so a long outage still trips `idle_timeout`.\n87:| `reconnect_backoff` | int (seconds) | `1` | Fixed wait between reconnect attempts. |\n206:    reconnect_backoff: 5         # wait 5s between attempts\n296:5. On a transport error or non-`1000` close with `reconnect: true`, the loop waits `reconnect_backoff`, reconnects, re-subscribes, and continues — counting consecutive failures against `max_reconnect_attempts`.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"ed2306e9-a3d1-4904-9def-5a047cb80584","timestamp":"2026-09-17T10:39:57.242Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"    /// Reconnect on transport error / non-1000 close.\n    #[serde(default)]\n    pub reconnect: bool,\n\n    /// Fixed wait (seconds) between reconnect attempts. Default 1s.\n    #[serde(\n        default = \"default_backoff\",\n        with = \"faucet_core::config::duration_secs\"\n16:- **Automatic reconnect** — opt-in `reconnect` with a fixed `reconnect_backoff` and an optional cap on *consecutive* failures (`max_reconnect_attempts`). The idle clock spans reconnect gaps, so a long outage still trips `idle_timeout`.\n87:| `reconnect_backoff` | int (seconds) | `1` | Fixed wait between reconnect attempts. |\n206:    reconnect_backoff: 5         # wait 5s between attempts\n296:5. On a transport error or non-`1000` close with `reconnect: true`, the loop waits `reconnect_backoff`, reconnects, re-subscribes, and continues — counting consecutive failures against `max_reconnect_attempts`.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1e2f1ccc-2062-4b86-ba39-adb39edf83e7","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"fix/audit-correctness-paths","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
